<div class="wrap" style="max-width:1088px">
<span class="eyebrow"><span class="kj">請</span>For foreigners freelancing &amp; running studios in Vietnam</span>
<h1 class="h1">Bill in their language.<br><span class="thin">Get paid on</span> <span class="em">their rail.</span></h1>
