<p class="sdd">Import a CSV or OFX statement and Akinai lines each transaction up against your open invoices — ranked High, Medium or Low confidence — so reconciliation is a glance and a click, not an afternoon.</p>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Duplicate transactions skipped automatically</div>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Confirm or override any suggested match</div>
</div>
</div></div></div>

<div class="divk"><span class="dl"></span><span class="dk">見</span><span class="dl"></span></div>

