<div>
<span class="seyebrow"><span class="kj">見</span>Estimates</span>
<h2 class="stt">Estimates your clients accept &amp; sign</h2>
<p class="sdd">Share an estimate on a secure link — no login for them. They accept and sign right in the browser; you get their name, email, IP and a timestamp on record. One click turns the accepted quote into an invoice.</p>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Legally-tracked digital signature</div>
<div class="bullet"><svg class="bk" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Convert to invoice, keep the numbers</div>
</div>
<div class="panel">
<div class="dochead"><div><div class="lab">Estimate</div><div class="mono" style="font-size:15px;margin-top:6px">EST-0044</div></div><span class="pbadge" style="color:oklch(.48 .11 155);background:oklch(.93 .05 155)"><span class="sd" style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:oklch(.48 .11 155)"></span>Accepted &amp; signed</span></div>
<div style="padding:22px 24px 8px"><div class="lab">Signed by</div><div class="sig" style="margin-top:8px">Maya Larsson</div></div>
<div style="padding:0 24px 18px"><div class="rsub" style="line-height:1.6">MAYA LARSSON · maya@@northwind.co<br>28 JUN 2026 · 14:07 UTC · IP 81.14.20.7</div></div>
<div class="fx ac jb" style="padding:14px 24px;background:var(--sunk);border-top:1px solid var(--line2)"><span class="lab">Converted</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--shu)">→ INV-0231</span></div>
</div>
</div></div></div>

<div class="divk"><span class="dl"></span><span class="dk">門</span><span class="dl"></span></div>

